<title>NETHERLANDS: DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Sept 9.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Sept 9.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said on Friday it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>    GMT----date----indicator------------period---previous</p>
<p>    0730  09/09    producer prices	July     +0.8 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>    0830  13/09    consumer prices	Aug	+2.1 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>NOTE - The CBS said that Dutch trade balance figures for June 1996, which had been postponed until further notice, will not be published next week. A new publication date will be announced later, the bureau said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
